### List a range (include_week_entries returns whole-week entries too; verify how)
GET {{baseUrl}}/households/mealplans?start_date=2026-11-23&end_date=2026-11-29&include_week_entries=true&perPage=-1&orderBy=date&orderDirection=asc
accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create (recipe entry; endDate set = whole-week entry, entryType required for the section)
POST {{baseUrl}}/households/mealplans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "date": "2026-11-26", "endDate": null, "entryType": "dinner", "title": "", "text": "", "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}", "recipeScale": 1 }

### Update (PUT needs the full body incl. id, groupId, userId)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/households/mealplans/{{entryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "id": 1, "groupId": "{{groupId}}", "userId": "{{userId}}", "date": "2026-11-27", "endDate": null, "entryType": "dinner", "title": "", "text": "", "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}", "recipeScale": 2 }

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/households/mealplans/{{entryId}}
Authorization: {{token}}

### Planner rules (day: monday..sunday|unset, entryType, queryFilterString)
GET {{baseUrl}}/households/mealplans/rules?perPage=-1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Household preferences (firstDayOfWeek)
GET {{baseUrl}}/households/preferences
Authorization: {{token}}

###
